            <sparkle:version>0.5.4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Keep Claude Desktop Code sessions bound to their selected timeline across reconnects and CUTTO restarts.
- Get more reliable project status and preparation before binding a timeline.

Open CUTTO after updating, then start a new Claude Desktop Code session.

Save your project and close DaVinci Resolve before updating, then reopen it.
]]></description>
